# XIOM language files.
#
# GitHub Linguist does not know "Xiom" yet: upstream recognition is gated on
# in-the-wild usage (2000+ files across repos not owned by the submitter) and
# overrides to unknown languages are ignored by design. The .xi extension is
# currently assigned to "Logos" upstream, so keep .xi out of the language
# statistics instead of reporting a wrong language, and use a close C-like
# grammar for in-browser highlighting.
#
# When Linguist merges "Xiom" (tracked in xiom-lang/.github, linguist/),
# replace this file's mapping with:  *.xi linguist-language=Xiom
*.xi linguist-language=Rust linguist-detectable=false

# XIOM FFI binding manifests are data, not source.
*.xiom-bind linguist-detectable=false
